<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-ULLRICH WINS 12TH STAGE OF THE TOUR DE FRANCE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-ULLRICH WINS 12TH STAGE OF THE TOUR DE FRANCE.</headline>
<dateline>ST ETIENNE, France 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jan Ullrich of Germany won the 12th stage of the Tour de France, a 55-km time-trial around St Etienne, on Friday.</p>
<p>Ullrich retained the overall leader's yellow jersey.</p>
</text>
